title: Expeditions live — Arky's real web dive → 3 cited external candidates on the board
summary: 'Ran the first real Expedition end-to-end. Extended paradigm_journal_record to carry a provenance envelope (source/trust/sourceSet) — the staging plumbing for foraged knowledge. Then sent Arky on a real vertical dive (''new paradigms for organizing TypeScript projects''): genuine WebSearch over Nx/moonrepo/feature-sliced.design/webpack, distilled to 3 cited candidates, ran the intake gate against OUR repo (verified a-paradigm ships 9 deliberate barrels bundled via tsup → authored SC-barrels-antipattern-vs-our-tooling), enrolled architect, and staged all 3 at trust:external with real sourceSet URLs. They appear on the live Academy board as external candidates, never touching a notebook — the firewall held end-to-end.'
