learnings:
  - 'Expeditions runs for real with one small plumbing change: paradigm_journal_record gaining an optional provenance:{source,trust,sourceSet} envelope is enough to stage foraged web candidates at trust:external — the Academy /staged route already read provenance, so they surface badged external with zero GUI change.'
  - 'The intake ''no scenario, no assessment'' gate is what makes external knowledge honest in practice: a foraged ''barrels are an anti-pattern'' claim, refuted against OUR repo (9 deliberate tsup-bundled barrels), becomes a challenger that the gate will refine to ''X except our framework packages'' — the scraped opinion can''t rewrite how we build, it can only earn a scoped exception.'
